## Overview
1. Fixes a State Sync Bug: The "Fan Auto" switch remained  ON  when the Thermostat was turned OFF because it was missing a power-status check. We updated the logic to turn it off cleanly:
```cpp
bool isAuto = s.power && (s.fanSpeed == CN105_FAN_AUTO);
```
2. Style Consistency: Standardized comparison operations in  homekit_switches.cpp  to use explicit grouping parentheses, matching  homekit_fan.cpp  and preventing potential compiler warnings.

#### Code Changes:
```cpp
  @@ -128,1 +128,1 @@
  -        bool isFanMode = (s.power && s.mode == CN105_MODE_FAN);
  +        bool isFanMode = s.power && (s.mode == CN105_MODE_FAN);

  @@ -244,1 +244,1 @@
  -        bool isDryMode = (s.power && s.mode == CN105_MODE_DRY);
